+3. `.env.example` → nusxa `.env`. `BOT_TOKEN=` ga @BotFather bergan tokenni, `ADMIN_TELEGRAM_IDS=` ga o'z Telegram id'ingizni yozing (@userinfobot), `DATABASE_URL=` ga PostgreSQL manzilini.
